Well, do you have
any idea how you got here?

34
00:04:10,714 --> 00:04:11,924
No.

35
00:04:12,007 --> 00:04:13,801
What's the last thing you remember?

36
00:04:13,884 --> 00:04:17,096
Nothing. I went to bed
in my shithole apartment

37
00:04:17,179 --> 00:04:19,056
