56
00:05:20,325 --> 00:05:21,243
<i>Yeah.</i>

57
00:05:24,288 --> 00:05:25,414
So...

58
00:05:26,999 --> 00:05:29,543
you gonna tell me your name or what?

59
00:05:33,714 --> 00:05:34,882
