94
00:09:19,189 --> 00:09:20,983
<i>Come on. You can do it.</i>

95
00:09:26,071 --> 00:09:27,614
Come on. Come on. Again.

96
00:09:51,388 --> 00:09:53,307
Rise and shine, Adam.

97
