118
00:11:02,584 --> 00:11:03,960
Dr. Gordon...

119
00:11:04,711 --> 00:11:06,505
<i>this is your wake-up call.</i>

120
00:11:07,297 --> 00:11:09,091
<i>Every day of your working life,</i>

121
00:11:09,174 --> 00:11:11,176
