Diana will die, Dr. Gordon,

132
00:11:58,306 --> 00:12:01,643
<i>and I'll leave you in this room to rot.</i>

133
00:12:03,228 --> 00:12:04,771
<i>Let the game begin.</i>

134
00:12:14,906 --> 00:12:16,283
Give me that.

135
00:12:17,117 --> 00:12:18,034
Now.

136
00:12:27,127 --> 00:12:31,006
Then Alison
and Diana will die. Dr. Gordon,

137
00:12:31,465 --> 00:12:34,551
