Dr. Gordon.

247
00:20:24,020 --> 00:20:25,647
He's a very interesting person.

248
00:20:27,941 --> 00:20:29,859
Thank you for that information, Zep.

249
00:20:29,943 --> 00:20:31,945
<i>As you can see, our orderlies form</i>

250
00:20:32,028 --> 00:20:34,238
