Think of it like a reverse bear trap.

516
00:44:34,636 --> 00:44:36,221
<i>I'll show you.</i>

517
00:44:40,642 --> 00:44:42,602
-Hey, Tapp.
-Hmm?

518
00:44:43,144 --> 00:44:45,563
<i>We're gonna go down</i>
<i>to the grill to get a beer.</i>

519
00:44:45,647 --> 00:44:47,857
-You want to come?
-I don't think so. Thanks anyway.

520
00:44:48,650 --> 00:44:49,859
Well, you know, I always ask.

521
00:44:50,402 --> 00:44:53,655
-There's only one key to open the device.
<i>-I'll leave you to have fun up here.</i>

522
00:44:53,738 --> 00:44:56,658
it's in
the stomach of your dead cellmate.

523
00:44:56,741 --> 00:44:57,867
Hey, Tapp.

524
00:44:57,951 --> 00:45:00,537
I don't mean for this to be disrespectful.

525
00:45:02,455 --> 00:45:05,125
Maybe you should
find yourself a girlfriend.

526
00:45:09,295 --> 00:45:10,964
<i> It's in</i>
<i>the stomach of your dead cellmate.</i>

527
00:45:11,047 --> 00:45:12,257
<i>Look around--</i>

528
00:45:15,218 --> 00:45:18,304
<i>Look around, Amanda.</i>
<i>Know that I'm not lying.</i>

529
00:45:19,055 --> 00:45:20,390
<i>You better hurry up.</i>

530
00:45:23,935 --> 00:45:26,563
Wait, wait, wait. Hey, Sing.

531
00:45:28,022 --> 00:45:29,899
-<i>What?</i>
-Get back here.

532
00:45:29,983 --> 00:45:32,193
Mmm!

533
00:45:38,116 --> 00:45:39,826
What?

534
00:45:43,830 --> 00:45:45,540
Remember 118th street?

535
00:45:47,876 --> 00:45:53,798
Uh...K2K. That gang's territory
was only about 4 blocks.

536
00:45:53,882 --> 00:45:54,924
Now listen to this.

537
00:46:08,771 --> 00:46:11,232
We got to check the records
for all the fire emergencies

538
00:46:11,316 --> 00:46:13,818
that occurred in
that area within the last 2 weeks.

539
00:46:13,902 --> 00:46:15,320
Go, right now. Mmm!

540
00:46:15,403 --> 00:46:17,280
<i>On the night of Tuesday the 17th,</i>

541
00:46:17,363 --> 00:46:18,990
we got a fire alarm going off

542
00:46:19,073 --> 00:46:21,743
in the rear wing of 213 Stygian Street.

543
00:46:21,951 --> 00:46:25,747
It's an old listing.
Used to be a mannequin factory.

544
00:46:25,830 --> 00:46:28,082
You think we have
enough for a warrant, though?

