548
00:46:32,545 --> 00:46:33,880
Yeah, why not?

549
00:46:44,974 --> 00:46:47,936
<i>At least we'll</i>
<i>have the cover of darkness.</i>

550
00:46:48,019 --> 00:46:50,939
<i>Yeah. Well, so will anybody else.</i>

551
00:47:36,276 --> 00:47:37,860
