552
00:48:30,330 --> 00:48:32,373
<i>What the hell is this?</i>

553
00:48:49,182 --> 00:48:51,184
Shit.

554
00:49:01,944 --> 00:49:02,945
Oh, fuck!

555
00:49:18,419 --> 00:49:20,880
Wait, Sing. Let's see what he's gonna do.

556
00:49:20,963 --> 00:49:23,007
