557
00:49:23,091 --> 00:49:24,926
We don't know what he looks like.

558
00:49:25,009 --> 00:49:26,344
No fucking way.

559
00:49:26,427 --> 00:49:28,137
Fuck that. I'm gonna take him.

560
00:49:28,221 --> 00:49:31,891
What the fuck? Shit!

561
00:50:17,770 --> 00:50:19,480
<i>Awake already, Jeff?</i>

562
00:50:21,149 --> 00:50:23,484
<i>I need more</i>
<i>powerful tranquilizers next time.</i>

563
00:50:23,568 --> 00:50:27,196
Don't cry. I've given your life a purpose.

564
00:50:27,655 --> 00:50:30,742
You're a test subject for
something greater than yourself.

565
00:50:30,825 --> 00:50:32,034
