-<i>It's in the box.</i>

576
00:51:02,106 --> 00:51:03,107
Box?

577
00:51:06,110 --> 00:51:07,195
Fuck!

578
00:51:09,155 --> 00:51:12,033
-Which key? Which key?
-Tell him which key!

579
00:51:12,116 --> 00:51:13,034
