583
00:51:22,335 --> 00:51:25,046
Get down on your knees, asshole!

584
00:51:25,129 --> 00:51:26,464
Hands behind your head!

585
00:51:28,508 --> 00:51:31,177
-Sick bastard!
-<i>Yes, I'm sick, officer.</i>

586
00:51:31,594 --> 00:51:33,221
Tapp, there's a bunch of keys here!

587
00:51:33,304 --> 00:51:35,598
Sick from the disease
eating away at me inside,

588
00:51:35,681 --> 00:51:38,768
sick of people who don't
appreciate their blessings,

589
00:51:38,851 --> 00:51:42,688
<i>sick of those who scoff</i>
<i>at the suffering of others.</i>

590
00:51:45,566 --> 00:51:47,151
I'm sick of it all!

591
00:51:48,319 --> 00:51:49,320
Tapp!

592
00:51:59,205 --> 00:52:05,211
No! No! Tapp! Tapp! Shit!
You're ok. Let me see.

593
00:52:05,294 --> 00:52:09,674
I'll be back. I'm gonna be back. Okay?

594
00:52:42,498 --> 00:52:45,376
Freeze, or I'll shoot!

595
00:54:15,007 --> 00:54:16,342
I had you.

596
00:54:17,009 --> 00:54:18,803
I had you on your knees.

597
00:54:20,554 --> 00:54:23,641
But you're running. You're running.

598
00:54:23,724 --> 00:54:27,436
You're running scared because we had you.

599
00:54:27,520 --> 00:54:30,314
We're gonna close this case.

600
00:54:30,398 --> 00:54:35,194
Gonna close it. Right, Sing? Right?

601
00:54:35,277 --> 00:54:37,780
We're gonna close it, Sing.

602
00:54:44,954 --> 00:54:49,041
"X" Marks
the spot. "X" Marks the spot.

603
00:54:49,125 --> 00:54:52,920
We need to search this room again.

604
00:54:53,045 --> 00:54:55,172
What are you doing over there?

605
00:54:56,424 --> 00:54:57,425
Excuse me.

606
00:54:59,176 --> 00:55:01,345
Just because I'm
stuck in this room with you

607
00:55:01,429 --> 00:55:03,597
<i>doesn't mean I have to report to you</i>
<i>every 10 seconds.</i>

608
00:55:04,306 --> 00:55:08,561
I really don't see the point
of us not helping one another.

609
00:55:09,103 --> 00:55:11,230
<i>What do you want me to do?</i>
<i>I'm on a leash.</i>

610
00:55:12,231 --> 00:55:14,400
That's exactly why we need to talk.
We need to think.

611
00:55:14,483 --> 00:55:15,818
I am thinking!

612
00:55:15,901 --> 00:55:19,113
Then don't keep me in
the dark about what you're thinking!

613
00:55:22,366 --> 00:55:23,534
Turn off the lights.

614
00:55:23,617 --> 00:55:25,161
<i>What?</i>

615
00:55:26,078 --> 00:55:28,247
