It must be
glow-in-the-dark paint or something.

621
00:56:39,527 --> 00:56:42,446
-Open it.
-<i>It's locked.</i>

622
00:56:43,072 --> 00:56:46,283
The key, the one from my envelope--
where is it?

623
00:56:50,037 --> 00:56:52,581
Where the fuck? Here.

624
00:57:20,943 --> 00:57:22,111
A cell phone--

625
00:57:22,194 --> 00:57:24,738
<i>the most beautiful</i>
<i>invention on this planet.</i>

626
00:57:30,411 --> 00:57:32,538
<i>Make that second most beautiful invention.</i>

627
00:57:32,621 --> 00:57:35,958
-Give me that.
-Are you joking? You're gonna put

628
00:57:36,041 --> 00:57:37,668
something that you found
in this room in your mouth?

629
00:57:39,587 --> 00:57:44,049
Yes. I'm willing to risk it.
Give me that sweet cancer.

630
00:57:45,050 --> 00:57:47,178
<i>I don't care. I really don't.</i>

631
00:57:47,553 --> 00:57:48,929
<i>Give me one of those.</i>

632
00:57:49,805 --> 00:57:52,183
<i> The cigarettes</i>
<i>are harmless, I promise.</i>

633
00:57:52,725 --> 00:57:56,395
