<i>when it ends in bloodshed.</i>

634
00:57:56,478 --> 00:57:57,563
Think about this.

635
00:57:57,646 --> 00:57:59,648
You don't need a gun to kill Adam.

636
00:58:00,191 --> 00:58:03,068
May I please have a cigarette?

637
00:58:03,944 --> 00:58:05,654
I'm trying the police.

638
00:58:16,540 --> 00:58:17,541
Shit.

639
