This was meant to
receive calls, not make them.

640
00:58:24,465 --> 00:58:25,883
<i>Wait a minute.</i>

641
00:58:26,717 --> 00:58:28,427
This has happened before.

642
00:58:32,264 --> 00:58:36,602
<i>Last night, after</i>
<i>I finished at the hospital...</i>

643
00:58:38,312 --> 00:58:40,439
<i>I was walking back to my car.</i>

644
00:58:41,815 --> 00:58:43,984
<i>I thought I was alone, but...</i>

645
00:58:44,860 --> 00:58:47,947
