652
01:00:35,971 --> 01:00:37,598
Instinct.

653
01:00:37,806 --> 01:00:39,058
Instinct?

654
01:00:39,141 --> 01:00:40,351
Yeah.

655
01:00:40,434 --> 01:00:43,604
You know what? You're a terrible liar.

656
01:00:43,937 --> 01:00:46,315
