658
01:00:49,485 --> 01:00:57,368
Well, um, let's see. On my sixth birthday,
my best friend at the time, Scott Tibbs,

659
01:00:57,451 --> 01:00:59,286
<i>stabbed me with a rusty nail.</i>
<i>I didn't tell you about that.</i>

660
01:00:59,370 --> 01:01:02,247
I didn't tell you that my last girlfriend,
who was a feminist vegan punk,

661
