673
01:01:46,583 --> 01:01:48,460
It was in your wallet...

674
01:01:49,211 --> 01:01:50,963
<i>behind the photo of your daughter.</i>

675
01:01:51,046 --> 01:01:53,799
Why didn't you show me this before?

676
