680
01:02:25,372 --> 01:02:29,126
Ok, I've got to think now.

681
01:02:32,129 --> 01:02:36,008
<i>Think about this.</i>
<i>You don't need a gun to kill Adam.</i>

682
01:02:36,633 --> 01:02:39,553
<i>When there's</i>
<i>that much poison in your blood,</i>

683
01:02:39,636 --> 01:02:43,307
