690
01:04:01,093 --> 01:04:04,221
Um, yeah.

691
01:04:04,304 --> 01:04:05,722
Sure.

692
01:05:15,083 --> 01:05:17,461
There! I've done it!

693
01:05:17,544 --> 01:05:20,213
