713
01:09:35,302 --> 01:09:37,012
What the--

714
01:09:39,890 --> 01:09:42,642
what the fuck is that?

715
01:09:52,235 --> 01:09:54,237
What the...

716
01:10:00,368 --> 01:10:02,203
Who is that?

717
01:10:02,871 --> 01:10:04,414
Who's in there?

718
01:10:06,333 --> 01:10:07,375
Come out!

719
01:10:07,459 --> 01:10:10,545
