746
01:12:02,991 --> 01:12:06,453
Don't believe Adam's lies.

747
01:12:07,412 --> 01:12:10,707
<i>He knows you.</i>
<i>He knew all about you before today.</i>

748
01:12:15,503 --> 01:12:18,048
Hello? Ali?

749
01:12:18,631 --> 01:12:20,133
Ali?

750
01:12:21,551 --> 01:12:22,844
Hello!

751
01:12:24,095 --> 01:12:25,388
Goddamn you!

752
01:12:25,555 --> 01:12:27,599
If you so much as lay a finger on them,

753
01:12:27,682 --> 01:12:28,892
